@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 400 — fake signature (no valid HMAC). MCP check: SELECT count(*) FROM provider_events — must NOT increase.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/razorpay
Content-Type: application/json
X-Razorpay-Signature: deadbeef
X-Razorpay-Event-Id: evt_fake_1

{"event":"payment.captured","payload":{"payment":{"entity":{"id":"pay_x","order_id":"order_x"}}}}

### 200 — unsigned body treated as validation failure (missing event id → PaymentValidationError → 200, never retryable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/razorpay
Content-Type: application/json

{}
